1
00:00:01,000 --> 00:00:02,000
<font color="#ffffff">The tide comes in at noon.</font>

2
00:00:02,000 --> 00:00:03,000
<font color="#00ff00">Bring the rope.</font>

3
00:00:03,000 --> 00:00:04,000
<font color="#00ffff">The boat is ready.</font>

4
00:00:04,000 --> 00:00:05,000
<font color="#ff0000">Mind the step!</font>

5
00:00:05,000 --> 00:00:06,000
<font color="#ffff00">(engine starts)</font>

6
00:00:06,000 --> 00:00:07,000
<font color="#ff00ff">Hold on tight.</font>

7
00:00:07,000 --> 00:00:08,000
<font color="#0000ff">We are off.</font>

8
00:00:08,000 --> 00:00:09,000
<font color="#000000">Quiet now.</font>

9
00:00:09,000 --> 00:00:10,000
<font color="#ffff00">[radio static]</font>

10
00:00:10,000 --> 00:00:11,000
Land ahead! <font color="#ffff00">Look!</font>
